  g303_qdb-d1e41102,37C19 (2);,Garn;,Subst;,"orig: In das Garn laufen;translated: jemand aufsitzen;orig: In das Garn gehen;translated: jemand aufsitzen;","","Ins Gå̄ᵃʳn [n,sg4]   lå̄ufn;Ins Gaarn n,sg4 laufn;","Ins Gå̄ᵃʳn [n,sg4]   gē̇ⁿ;Ins Gaarn n,sg4 gen;","","",6.5 Wien;,6.5w06 Mauer;,"",""
  g303_qdb-d1e44526,37C19 (F);,Garn;,Subst;,"--;","","Rupfas Gåʳn, hārwas Gåʳn, / d' Wöwəʳ dö hand narös̄ch wåʳn, / hand iwəʳ d' Dǫanəʳ gfåʳn, / hąmd an Šdreŋ Gåʳn fəlåʳn; - / d' Fis̄chəʳ, dö hąmd nåchö gfischt, / hąmd ön Šdreŋ Gåʳn dəwischt;Rupfas Garn, harwas Garn, / d Wöwer dö hand narösch warn, / hand iwer d Doaner gfarn, / hamd an Sdreng Garn felarn  / d Fischer, dö hamd nachö gfischt, / hamd ön Sdreng Garn dewischt;","","","",5.3 Traunv.;,5.3b02 Gmunden;,"",""
